  "description": "A fluent C#/.NET library for server-side SVG chart and data-visualization generation — zero JavaScript, zero external dependencies. Renders 26 chart types (Line, Spline, Area, Column, Bar, Pie/Donut, Scatter, Bubble, Heatmap, Waterfall, Gauge, DataRing, Radar, BoxPlot, Candlestick, OHLC, Funnel, Treemap, Gantt, Sankey, Parliament, and more) as Static, Animated, or Interactive SVG — ideal for PDF reports, email, dashboards, ASP.NET Core, and Blazor.",
