  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0 — Multi-colour bars (ColorByPoint), collision-aware data labels, 64px bar thickness cap, rounded corners on the free bar end only, larger default text with a 10px minimum, width-aware date-axis label thinning. Fixes left Y-axis range with a secondary axis or stacking. Up to 60× faster rendering of dense labelled charts. Full notes: https://github.com/sahebansari/TerraFluent.Chart.Reporting/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
